B.a0V=new A.kf("What this app is\u2014and is not","ClutterCash helps you identify visible items that may be worth selling and provides potential selling-value ranges and marketplace research links. It is not an appraisal, authentication service, marketplace, financial advisor, transaction tracker, listing tool, or guarantee of a sale. Verify model, condition, accessories, price, and marketplace rules before posting.",null)
B.a0U=new A.kf("Photos and AI processing","When you choose a live scan or model-label photo and accept the upload notice, the app sends the image through ClutterCash\u2019s Cloudflare Worker to Google Gemini. The Worker processes image bytes in memory and is designed not to write them to disk. Google may review free-tier submissions and use them to improve its products. Never upload faces, mail, addresses, keys, medication, documents, account information, or other sensitive/private content.",null)
B.a0W=new A.kf("Your data and local storage","This beta has no account or cloud project sync. Projects, results, corrections, and item statuses stay in local app/browser storage on this device. Live AI routes require a revocable invite code and reserve limits through a Cloudflare Durable Object; this is beta access protection, not a user account or profile.",null)
B.a0R=new A.kf("Minimal beta diagnostics","An invited build sends only allow-listed event names for scan progress, local project creation or reopening, item corrections or status updates, and coarse app-crash categories to ClutterCash Worker logs. These events do not include photos, item or project names, values, invite codes or hashes, error text, or device/account IDs. Delivery is best-effort. Cloudflare and network providers may process standard connection data under their own policies.",null)
B.a0S=new A.kf("Delete your data","Use Saved projects to delete one project or all local projects. You can also uninstall the app or clear this site/app\u2019s storage. These actions cannot be undone. ClutterCash does not provide cloud image storage or a provider-deletion tool; Google\u2019s handling of uploaded photos is governed by Google\u2019s policies.",null)
B.a0X=new A.kf("Your responsibility","Use the beta only if you are at least 18 and have permission to photograph the space and items. Marketplace searches are user-facing links, not scraped price data or direct posting. Verify the item and price yourself and follow each marketplace\u2019s rules, fees, taxes, safety guidance, and terms.",null)
B.a0T=new A.kf("Support and feedback","For beta support, feedback, privacy questions, or help deleting local data, email the support inbox below. Do not email sensitive photos, serial numbers, passwords, account information, or payment details.",null)
